BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 775.89 Tm (- Prettier for consistent formatting.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 754.89 Tm (- SQL migration files for database changes.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 733.89 Tm (The database library must be compiled before the NestJS API requires it. Its runtime path points to) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 719.89 Tm (compiled CommonJS output, which keeps the API build compatible with the shared package.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 684.89 Tm (6. API contract and integration boundaries) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 678.89 m 130 678.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 658.89 Tm (The API uses a global `/api` prefix. JSON is the default payload format. Swagger is mounted at) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 644.89 Tm (`/api/docs`. Protected requests use:) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 623.89 Tm (Authorization: Bearer <access-token>) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 605.39 Tm (Redis 7 is a required production dependency for the implemented cross-replica Socket.IO adapter. The) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 591.39 Tm (Kubernetes template stores `REDIS_PASSWORD` and the credential-bearing `REDIS_URL` in a Secret,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 577.39 Tm (permits Redis ingress only from API pods, and denies Redis egress. Redis and web pods explicitly run) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.39 Tm (as non-root without privilege escalation. The included internal Redis service is password-protected) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 549.39 Tm (but does not provide TLS; real production should prefer a managed, private TLS Redis service and a) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 535.39 Tm (`rediss://` URL. Separate future integrations would still be required for a shared cache or a durable) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 521.39 Tm (event bus. RabbitMQ or Kafka for durable event delivery, Elasticsearch for search, S3 or MinIO for) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 507.39 Tm (object storage, and an external identity provider for OAuth2/OIDC/LDAP/SSO remain architectural) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 493.39 Tm (extension points.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 458.39 Tm (7. Architectural trade-offs) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 452.39 m 130 452.39 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 432.39 Tm (- A modular monolith keeps transactions and deployment simple while the hotel domain is still) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 418.39 Tm (  evolving.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 397.39 Tm (- PostgreSQL and Drizzle provide a strong relational model and typed queries without adding a) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 383.39 Tm (  separate service layer.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 362.39 Tm (- Redis-backed Socket.IO supports realtime delivery across API replicas, while cache entries) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 348.39 Tm (  and EventEmitter2 domain events remain process-local.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.39 Tm (- The 10Gi ReadWriteOnce upload volume and required API pod affinity support the current) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.39 Tm (  three-replica, single-node storage boundary; multi-node API placement requires shared or) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 299.39 Tm (  object storage.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 278.39 Tm (- Explicit public routes make Prometheus and refresh flows practical while global) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 264.39 Tm (  authentication remains fail-closed.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.39 Tm (- Tenant-aware enterprise services are safer than pretending the legacy core tables already) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 229.39 Tm (  have complete tenant isolation.) Tj ET
